            <ArticleTitle>Several clinical aspects of thalamic pulvinotomy.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>162-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Several clinical aspects of thalamic pulvinotomy were investigated. Influence of electrical stimulation of pulvinar on consciousness, speech, memory, evoked response, emotion, intelligence, character, ophthalmic and auditory examinations were studied during operation and compared between pre-, post, and during operation.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
